<div class="callout info small" style="margin-bottom:16px">Only contacts marked <strong>Subscribed</strong> receive campaigns. People are subscribed when they tick the box on sign-up, use the newsletter form, or when you import a list that has agreed to hear from you. Customers, applicants and registrants are saved here for convenience but are <em>not</em> subscribed by default.</div>
